  "category": {
    "name": "sandwich-ingredients",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/53/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味が　ある　食材。味自体は　淡泊だが　コクが　あるので食べ応えは　十分なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛이 나는 식재료. 맛 자체는 담백하나 진한 맛이 있어서 포만감을 느끼기에는 충분하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有甜味的食材。味道本身清淡，但又顯得濃郁，因此口感十足。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût sucré. Sa saveur subtile est contrebalancée par son onctuosité, ce qui en fait un ingrédient nourrissant et très agréable à déguster.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die cremige Note dieser süßlichen Zutat bietet einen Ausgleich zu ihrer aromatischen Schlichtheit und garantiert ein zufriedenstellendes Geschmackserlebnis.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Posee un sabor dulce y algo simplón, pero es bastante contundente, por lo que sacia enseguida.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente dolce. Ha un sapore abbastanza neutro e una corposità che lo rende piuttosto sostanzioso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An ingredient with sweet notes—though its flavor is very mild. The avocado’s richness, however, makes it satisfying to eat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味が　ある　食材。味自体は　淡泊だが　コクが　あるので食べ応えは　十分なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带有甜味的食材。味道本身虽淡薄但有深度，吃起来足够让人满足。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Posee un sabor dulce y algo simplón, pero es bastante contundente, por lo que sacia enseguida.",
